"| Eve's guess bases      | Z       | Z       | Z       | Z       | X       | ...|\n"
"| Eve's states (a priori)      | ? | $\\vert 0\\rangle$ | ? | $\\vert 0\\rangle$ | $\\vert +\\rangle$ |...|\n"
