"| Basis Bob      | X       | Z       | X       | Z       | X       | ...|\n"
"| Keadaan Bob (a priori)      | ? | $\\vert 0\\rangle$ | $\\vert +\\rangle$ | $\\vert 0\\rangle$ | $\\vert +\\rangle$ |...|\n"
"| Keadaan Bob (diukur)      | $\\vert -\\rangle$ | $\\vert 0\\rangle$ | $\\vert +\\rangle$ | $\\vert 0\\rangle$  | $\\vert +\\rangle$ |...|\n"
